// codebox_pass.gen -- f_formconstants stage 0: holds last frame's state
// (E, I, Ve, Vi), or reseeds it. Render-resolution float32 (@adapt 0,
// `r dim` resize). Mirror: fc_mirror.seed_state() (seeding), identity otherwise.
// Same mechanism as f_wc's codebox_pass.gen, fc channel layout.
//
// Inputs: the first inlet is the `r draw` bang (unused; it only triggers the
// render every frame, and the feedback arrives on a cold inlet so it cannot
// retrigger the loop), the second is the feedback state (R = E, G = I, B = Ve,
// A = Vi, from the nl stage through the hold stage), the third is the noise
// texture (R = seed-E hash, G = seed-I hash, from the seed stage).
// reseed = 1 replaces the state with uniform noise in [0, amp): E from R, I
// from G (two independent hash channels), never zero and never uniform rest
// (it is a fixed point of the whole update, FR-004). reseed fires on load, on
// the reset trigger (FR-009), and on a render-size change (T013: `r dim`
// -> delay -> the reseed trigger -- the deliberate resize seam).
//   - SELF-HEAL: a feedback texel that is exactly 0 in BOTH of R, G is
//     reseeded from the noise too. A live WC field never holds an exact 0
//     (E, I stay inside (0, 1): relaxation toward a sigmoid output), so this
//     fires only when the state was lost: a fresh module, a GL context rebuilt
//     by a window mode change, or a non-finite texel the nl stage zapped
//   - selection uses switch(), not mix(): mix(NaN, x, 1) is still NaN, so a
//     poisoned feedback texel could survive a reseed through mix
//   - the feedback is NaN/Inf-guarded: abs(x) < 1e30 (NaN == NaN is TRUE on
//     this GPU)
//   - packing: R = E, G = I, B = Ve, A = Vi (the fc state layout, shared by
//     pass, blur_x, blur_y, nl, enc -- Ve/Vi ride the spare channels THROUGH
//     the blur stages untouched). Ve/Vi reset to 0 on reseed and on self-heal:
//     the adaptation memory restarts with the new pattern. With habit = 0 the
//     nl stage writes 0 in B, A, so B, A stay exactly 0 (T002's free-run
//     dynamics are untouched).
Param reseed(0);
Param amp(1);

fbe = nearest(in2, norm).x;
fbe = switch(abs(fbe) < 1e30, fbe, 0);
fbi = nearest(in2, norm).y;
fbi = switch(abs(fbi) < 1e30, fbi, 0);
fbv = nearest(in2, norm).z;
fbv = switch(abs(fbv) < 1e30, fbv, 0);
fbw = nearest(in2, norm).w;
fbw = switch(abs(fbw) < 1e30, fbw, 0);
ze = nearest(in3, norm).x * amp;
zi = nearest(in3, norm).y * amp;
lost = (fbe == 0) * (fbi == 0);
kept_e = switch(lost > 0.5, ze, fbe);
kept_i = switch(lost > 0.5, zi, fbi);
kept_ve = switch(lost > 0.5, 0, fbv);
kept_vi = switch(lost > 0.5, 0, fbw);
out1 = vec(switch(reseed >= 0.5, ze, kept_e), switch(reseed >= 0.5, zi, kept_i),
           switch(reseed >= 0.5, 0, kept_ve), switch(reseed >= 0.5, 0, kept_vi));
